// Gap 7: the "..." marker is the last parameter of a user "extern fun". A call
// may pass any number of extra arguments after the fixed ones, each of a
// scalar, "bool", "str" or opaque-handle type; the compiler generates one
// fixed-arity C wrapper per distinct list of extra types and the call goes
// through it, so neither backend emits a variadic call itself.
pub extern fun kelp_va_sum(count: i32, ...).R: i32
pub extern fun kelp_va_mix(count: i32, ...).R: i32
